<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on McDonald&quot;s.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on McDonald&quot;s.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on McDonald's common stock, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. oHG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   23.DEC.96	   SPOT REFERENCE  $45.50</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, STUTT,   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>	     STRIKE   ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL	$48.0    0.67 DEM  15.01 PCT   10.51 X  17.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL	$55.0    0.70 DEM  30.82 PCT   10.07 X  17.DEC.98</p>
<p> NOTES	     - </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
